OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry in the southeast at
OL,6,Ffirst, otherwise bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a few scattered showers
OL,8,Fthrough the day. Winds will be
OL,9,Fmoderate west or northwesterlies.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMost places will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear spells this evening and
OL,13,Fovernight, although a few light
OL,14,Fshowers remain possible at first.
OL,15,FTurning rather cold with light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,18,Frisk of frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,19,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,20,Fsunny spells and some patchy cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
